-- SATURN X / DANCE / v1.0.0-dance-beta / Created by BM
-- Animation-ID player for the local player's existing Humanoid / Animator.
-- Standard APIs only: Animator:LoadAnimation and AnimationTrack playback controls.
-- https://create.roblox.com/docs/reference/engine/classes/Animator
-- https://create.roblox.com/docs/reference/engine/classes/AnimationTrack
-- Requires an accessible animation and a compatible character rig.
-- A catalog emote/product ID is not necessarily an Animation ID.
-- Uses the character's existing Animator. Visibility to others is game-dependent.
-- Does not disable Animate, replace the character, or stop unrelated tracks.
-- Cancelled or superseded loads cannot restart dancing. Respawn stops playback.
-- Original silver Saturn and both MP3 files embedded; no remote code or telemetry.
-- No live Roblox runtime test was available. Right Shift: menu. End: stop.

